---
// Final CTA before the footer. Three rounds so far: (1) CSS-drawn corrugated
// panel with white text on it; (2) swapped in the user's real container
// photo, still as a bordered card; (3) user pushed for a "premium" poster
// look — ref: bold gradient headline with a container photo integrated
// directly into the composition, no card/border, floating on a plain
// background (their ref used an angled crane shot; they explicitly want the
// straight side-view container kept, just the same production quality).
// Rebuilt around that: large gradient-text headline, then the container
// (background removed — see public/cta/container-cutout.png, chroma-keyed
// via sharp since the source had a flat white background) floating below it
// with a soft shadow and a blurred color glow, rather than sitting in a
// bordered box with text painted on its surface.
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p
      data-reveal
      class="translate-y-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-red uppercase opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out"
    >
      Get In Touch
    </p>
    <h2
      data-reveal
      class="cta-heading mt-5 translate-y-8 text-4xl leading-[1.05] font-extrabold tracking-tight opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
    >
      Let Us Take the Burden of Your Cargo
    </h2>
    <p
      data-reveal
      class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl translate-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-navy/60 opacity-0 transition-all delay-150 duration-700 ease-out sm:text-lg"
    >
      Talk to our team and get a tailored freight solution built around your cargo, wherever it needs to go.
    </p>

    <a
      href="/quote"
      data-reveal
      class="group mt-8 inline-flex translate-y-8 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-red to-[#a3121c] px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white opacity-0 shadow-lg shadow-brand-red/25 transition-all delay-300 duration-700 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl"
    >
      Get a Quote
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">
        <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div data-reveal class="cta-container-wrap relative mx-auto mt-14 max-w-5xl translate-y-8 px-6 opacity-0 transition-all delay-450 duration-700 ease-out sm:mt-20">
    <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <img src="/cta/container-cutout.png" alt="Red shipping container" class="relative mx-auto w-full drop-shadow-2xl" />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-heading {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #152056 15%, rgba(21, 32, 86, 0.55));
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10% 15%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(216, 31, 42, 0.22) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(40px);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .cta-container-wrap img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
</style>
